","value":"V = SL"},{"type":"text","value":"……（2分）\n（3）气体压强"},{"type":"math","value":"P = P_{0} + \\frac{mg}{S} = \\frac{5mg}{S}"},{"type":"text","value":"由气体温度升高"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta T = \\frac{1}{2} T"},{"type":"text","value":"，气体膨胀对外做功 W"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -P \\cdot (2SL - SL) = -5mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1分)\n气体内能"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = k \\Delta T = k \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} T"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1 分)\n由热力学第一定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n则"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\frac{1}{2} kT + 5mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2411-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"taizhou-yimo-2411-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d3c601a9da3572cc9127a48128cd6dc6a940e9d2272ec076f267b715e996a682","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （11分）如图为某挑战项目的示意图，其中弹射装置由弹射器和物块组成，质量分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 5m"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。弹射装置被挑战者从滑道平台起点 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 由静止释放，从滑道 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 点冲出，当到达最高点 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，挑战者启动弹射器在极短时间将物块沿水平方向射出，且刚好水平进入右侧静置于光滑水平地面的质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{m}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的组合平台。如果弹射器落到下方宽度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2h"},{"type":"text","value":" 的缓冲保护区，且物块能到达右侧光滑 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 圆弧轨道，也不从组合平台左侧脱离，则视为挑战成功。已知平台 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点离地高为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{5}{2} h, D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点与 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的水平距离与高度均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h"},{"type":"text","value":" ，装置到最高 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点时速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D} = \\sqrt{2gh}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，平台上表面的水平长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF = 2h"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其与物块的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = \\frac{7}{8}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，g为重力加速度。弹射器和物块均可视为质点，不计空气阻力。求：\n（1）弹射装置在滑道上运动过程中，克服滑道阻力所做的功；\n（2）若弹射器射出物块后能落到缓冲保护区内，则在 D 点弹射器对物块的冲量最大值；\n（3）若要挑战成功，弹射器射出物块的速度大小应满足的条件。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/74608549e1310360fb1d09076ca69860a9a2b02c3a86b4f587062174509a107e.png","width":806,"height":431,"width_mm":94.714,"row_group":"taizhou-yimo-2411-q18-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（11分）\n（1）由O到D动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"6mg(\\frac{5}{2}h-h)-W_{f}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times6mv_{D}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"W_{f}=3mgh"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）弹射器射出物块后，其速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，向后平抛落入缓冲区，则\n水平："},{"type":"math","value":"x=v_{1}t\\leq h"},{"type":"text","value":"，竖直："},{"type":"math","value":"h=\\frac{1}{2}gt^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}\\leq\\frac{\\sqrt{2gh}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由射出物块时弹射器受到水平冲量"},{"type":"math","value":"I=-5mv_{1}-5mv_{D}"},{"type":"text","value":"则最大值："},{"type":"math","value":"I=-5mv_{1}-5mv_{D}=-\\frac{15}{2}m\\sqrt{2gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由弹射器射出物块的冲量"},{"type":"math","value":"I'=-I=5mv_{1}+5mv_{D}=\\frac{15}{2}m\\sqrt{2gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）若物块恰能进入圆弧，由动量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{2}=(m+\\frac{1}{6}m)v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由能量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu mg\\cdot2h=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}(m+\\frac{1}{6}m)v_{\\text{共}}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=\\frac{7\\sqrt{2gh}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n若物块恰能返回至装置E点，由动量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{3}=(m+\\frac{1}{6}m)v_{\\text{共}}^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":"由能量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu mg\\cdot4h=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{3}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}(m+\\frac{1}{6}m)v_{\\text{共}}^{'2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{3}=7\\sqrt{gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"即物块的速度满足："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{7}{2}\\sqrt{2gh}\\leq v_{\\text{物}}\\leq7\\sqrt{gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n考虑弹射器的安全，物块的速度需要满足："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{7}{2}\\sqrt{2gh}\\leq v_{\\text{物}}\\leq\\frac{17}{2}\\sqrt{2gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n综合知挑战成功需要满足："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{7}{2}\\sqrt{2gh}\\leq v_{\\text{物}}\\leq7\\sqrt{gh}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2411-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"taizhou-yimo-2411-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"da3974bbec2c0add440e48a94bd12aa8d0c58ad21df9551d9ef5bad1d3ccf334","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. （11分）如图所示，虚线框内简化模型为旋转磁极式发电机，线圈abcd的匝数 "},{"type":"math","value":"N = 100"},{"type":"text","value":" 内阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"r = 1\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ，与倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"d = 1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 且足够长的金属导轨相连。导轨上接有理想电压表， "},{"type":"math","value":"C = 2\\mathrm{F}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电容器，及被锁定在距离底端足够远的 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 金属棒和静置于水平足够长光滑导轨的 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 金属棒， "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 棒质量均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电阻均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 1\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 。导轨间存在垂直导轨平面向下且 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = 1\\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 棒与导轨的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.75"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},