d^{2}+m}=2m/s,\\quad q=4C"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n（3）对 a、b 金属棒由动量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{1}=2mv_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}}=1m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1 分）\n对 b 金属棒动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"Bd\\overline{I}t=mv_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"且"},{"type":"math","value":"q'=\\overline{I}t=\\frac{Bdx_{\\text{相}}}{2R}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1 分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{相}}=4m"},{"type":"text","value":"，即至少相距 4m……（1 分）\n（4）a金属棒进入水平轨道后，共速前产生热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times\\left(\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2mv_{\\text{共}}^{2}\\right)=1J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n共速到 a 金属棒离开磁场，对 a 棒由动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{B^{2}d^{2}x_{0}}{2R}=mv_{2}-mv_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=0.5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"则此过程 a 棒产生热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times\\left(\\frac{1}{2}mv_{\\text{共}}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2}\\right)=\\frac{3}{8}J"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n则 a 棒产生的总热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{总}}=Q_{1}+Q_{2}=\\frac{11}{8}J"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2411-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2411","source_question_id":"taizhou-yimo-2411-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3e813c24a2963597e4fb504716af274d5285af32ab96fa1eda5bab84b18eef36","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20. （11分）如图甲为自由电子激光器，它能将相对论性自由电子束的动能转变成相干的电磁辐射能的装置，其核心部件“扭摆器”由 "},{"type":"math","value":"2n"},{"type":"text","value":" 对极性交替水平排列的永磁体构成，每对永磁体长宽分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2L"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" ，产生竖直方向空间交替的静磁场。其基本原理可简化为：电子束加速器可在水平方向自由移动，初速度为零的自由电子经电压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 的加速器加速后，垂直进入水平面半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆形磁场并被引入扭摆器，电子在垂直于磁场的方向上“扭动”前进，每次“扭动”都转化为激光辐射，通过光学系统输出。如图乙所示，两个完全相同的圆形磁场与扭摆器两端相切，圆心均在 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴，若电子束对准圆心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 入射时，能沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴方向进入扭摆器。已知电子质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，带电荷 "},{"type":"math","value":"-e"},{"type":"text","value":" ，忽略电子加速后速度损失、相对论效应及辐射过程中的动能损耗。求：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/77b7fecae4318239e0dc380f767d9fc1fc4c4fb22f8fe0e0fcb0ce98ab7b613b.png","width":1266,"height":312,"width_mm":148.869,"row_group":"taizhou-yimo-2411-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第20题图\n（1）圆形磁场的磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）若上下一对永磁体间的磁感应强度恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，当电子束从 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点进入的速度与 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，能经过扭摆器后被完整收集，则 ① 电子束加速器需要向右平移多少距离； ② 电子束在磁场中运动的总时间。\n（3）实际上，扭摆器的上下一对永磁体间磁感应强度大小有变化，假设在 "},{"type":"math","value":"0 < x < L"},{"type":"text","value":" 范围内沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的磁感应强度与位置 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 近似满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"B(x) = B_0\\frac{x}{L}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。若电子束从 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{2eB_0L}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，与 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向夹角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha = 60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 斜向右上方射入磁场，则电子束从 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点运动到离 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴最远（不超过 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 且仍在磁场中）的过程中运动轨迹与 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴围成的面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（11 分）（1）由动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"eU=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2eU}{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n由题意知 r=R，又"},{"type":"math","value":"eB_{1}v_{0}=\\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=\\frac{1}{R}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mU}{e}}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n（2）如图所示，由几何关系可知电子加速器水平移动距离"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = R\\sin 30^{\\circ} = \\frac{R}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）在圆形磁场中周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1} = \\frac{2\\pi m}{eB_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"经过两个圆形磁场的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1 = \\frac{60^\\circ + 120^\\circ}{360^\\circ} T_1 = \\frac{1}{2} T_1"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n在扭摆器磁场中的周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T_2 = \\frac{2\\pi m}{eB_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"经扭摆器时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2 = 2n \\cdot \\frac{60^\\circ}{360^\\circ} T_2 = \\frac{n}{3} T_2"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n总时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{\\text{总}} = t_1 + t_2 = \\frac{1}{2} T_1 + \\frac{n}{3} T_2 = \\pi R \\sqrt{\\frac{m}{2eU}} + \\frac{2n\\pi m}{3eB_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（3）由图可知，离 y 轴最远时，v 与 y 轴平行，\n任"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"内，由水平方向动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\sum eBv_{y} \\cdot \\Delta t = 0 - mv \\cos \\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1 分)\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta y = \\sum v_{y} \\cdot \\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"，且"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2} = B_{0} \\cdot \\frac{x}{L}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1 分)\n则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{eB_{0}}{L}\\sum x \\cdot \\Delta y = mv \\cos \\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"又"},{"type":"math","value":"S = \\sum x \\cdot \\Delta y = L \\cdot \\frac{mv \\cos \\alpha}{eB_{0}} = L^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1 分)\n即电子束与 y 轴围成的面积"},{"type":"math","value":"S = L^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1 分)"}]}}]}
